<article class="pan-form-leads">
<div class="pan-form-leads__holder">
<div class="pan-form-leads__wrapper">
<header class="pan-form-leads__header"><img alt="Logo Banco Pan" class="pan-form-leads__icon" height="29" width="17" src="/bancopan-institucional/conteudo/estrutura/assets/img/logo-pan-simples.svg"><button aria-label="Fechar formulário" class="pan-form-leads__closer" type="button"><span aria-hidden="true">Fechar formulário</span></button></header>

<div class="pan-form-leads__main">
<form class="pan-form-leads__form" id="Form_AbrirConta" method="post">
<div class="pan-form__row">
<div class="pan-field"><input autocomplete="off" class="pan-field__input" id="nome" name="nome" required type="text"> <label class="pan-field__label" for="nome">Nome completo</label><span class="pan-field__assistive pan-field__assistive-nome">Por favor preencha um nome válido.</span></div>
</div>

<div class="pan-form__row">
<div class="pan-field"><input autocomplete="off" class="pan-field__input" id="email" name="email" required type="email"> <label class="pan-field__label" for="email">E-mail</label><span class="pan-field__assistive pan-field__assistive-email">Por favor preencha um e-mail válido.</span></div>
</div>

<div class="pan-form__row">
<div class="pan-field"><input autocomplete="off" class="pan-field__input" id="celular" name="celular" required type="text"> <label class="pan-field__label" for="celular">Celular</label><span class="pan-field__assistive pan-field__assistive-celular">Por favor inserir um número de celular válido.</span></div>
</div>

<div class="pan-form__row">
<div class="pan-field"><input autocomplete="off" class="pan-field__input" id="cpf" name="cpf" required type="text"> <label class="pan-field__label" for="cpf">CPF</label> <span class="pan-field__assistive pan-field__assistive-cpf">Por favor insira um CPF válido.</span></div>
</div>

<div class="pan-form__row">
<div class="pan-field pan-field--checkbox"><input autocomplete="off" class="pan-field__input" id="receber_infos" name="receber_infos" type="checkbox" value="Sim"> <label class="pan-field__label" for="receber_infos">Quero receber ofertas, descontos, lançamentos e informações.</label></div>
</div>

<div class="pan-form__row">
<div class="g-recaptcha" data-callback="openAccountConfirmCallback" data-sitekey="6LcV7B0cAAAAAJexhq0eiwlqsCC2n99V0DpT7UcC">&nbsp;</div>
</div>

<div class="pan-form__actions"><button class="pan-btn pan-btn--disabled pan-form-leads__submit" type="submit">Continuar Cadastro</button></div>
</form>

<div class="pan-success-message" style="background: #fff;overflow: hidden;">
<h2 style="text-align:center; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:.5em">Obrigado!</h2>

<p>Agora, fique de olho: você receberá o convite da sua Conta Digital PAN pelo e-mail cadastrado.</p>
<small style="font-weight:800;font-size: .9em;">ou acesse agora a loja de aplicativos do seu dispositivo.</small>

<div class="digital-account-buttons pan-success-message--desk" style="padding-left: 0;flex-direction: row;margin-top: 1em;margin-bottom: 1em;height: auto;"><a class="digital-account-buttons__btn" id="pan-form-leads__googleplay" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="Baixar o aplicativo no Google Play" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=br.com.bancopan.cartoes&amp;hl=pt_BR"><img alt="Google Play" height="38" loading="lazy" width="128" src="/bancopan-institucional/conteudo/produtos/conta-digital/assets/img/google-play-dark.svg"> </a> <a id="pan-form-leads__applestore" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="Baixar o aplicativo na Apple Sotre" href="https://bancopan.onelink.me/zIun/"> <img alt="Apple Store" height="38" loading="lazy" width="128" src="/bancopan-institucional/conteudo/produtos/conta-digital/assets/img/apple-store-dark.svg"> </a></div>

<p class="pan-success-message--desk">Se preferir, leia o QR Code com a câmera do seu celular para ir diretamente à loja de aplicativos:</p>

<div class="pan-form-leads__qr-code pan-success-message--desk" style="margin: 0;transform: translateY(-1em);">&nbsp;</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
